{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"password"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ke2"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ksf"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV","text":"KsfParams"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A failure here is the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"whole"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of the client’s authentication check, and covers both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves of the mutual authentication: the envelope only opens under the right password, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"type":"text","text":"’s MAC only verifies if the server actually holds the record. Nothing may be sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"afterwards (§23.4 rule 7)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That case is an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", unlike every other refusal in this package. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","t